    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mastery of souls grants you new ways to use soul fragments.</p><p><strong>Disrupt.</strong> You can expend two soul fragments to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCounterspe]{Counterspell} in response to that spell's trigger, using your spellcasting ability.</p><p><strong>Warglaive Mastery.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can expend one soul fragment to cast @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.6K9bd7HLoBIKqFR7]{Throw Glaive} without expending a spell slot.</p>",
